From: Chokri Hammedi <52697989+blue0x1@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] debug: time one frame in 16 on the GPU with a perf-log file

With a file named perf-log in the working folder, one frame in every 16 gets
a GPU timestamp after each guest draw and dispatch and each emulator pass.
Once that frame completes, the log lists where its GPU time went, by
pipeline or shader. Not for a release.

